[{"id":"fm-core1-1.56-q1","number":1,"question":"<p>Find the vector product equation of the line:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>that passes through <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(2,8,1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and is parallel to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"5\\mathbf i-2\\mathbf j+3\\mathbf k\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p>that passes through <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-10,3,-5)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and is parallel to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"7\\mathbf i-\\mathbf k\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\left(\\mathbf r-\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\8\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\\right)\\times\\begin{pmatrix}5\\\\-2\\\\3\\end{pmatrix}=\\mathbf0.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\left(\\mathbf r-\\begin{pmatrix}-10\\\\3\\\\-5\\end{pmatrix}\\right)\\times\\begin{pmatrix}7\\\\0\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}=\\mathbf0.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.56-q2","number":2,"question":"<p>Show that the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(2,0,3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> lies on the line with equation</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\left(\\mathbf r-\\begin{pmatrix}6\\\\3\\\\-2\\end{pmatrix}\\right)\\times\\begin{pmatrix}4\\\\3\\\\-5\\end{pmatrix}=\\mathbf0.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\left(\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\0\\\\3\\end{pmatrix}-\\begin{pmatrix}6\\\\3\\\\-2\\end{pmatrix}\\right)\\times\\begin{pmatrix}4\\\\3\\\\-5\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-4\\\\-3\\\\5\\end{pmatrix}\\times\\begin{pmatrix}4\\\\3\\\\-5\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{vmatrix}\\mathbf i&amp;\\mathbf j&amp;\\mathbf k\\\\-4&amp;-3&amp;5\\\\4&amp;3&amp;-5\\end{vmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=((-3)\\times(-5)-5\\times3)\\mathbf i-((-4)\\times(-5)-5\\times4)\\mathbf j+((-4)\\times3-(-3)\\times4)\\mathbf k.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=0\\mathbf i+0\\mathbf j+0\\mathbf k=\\mathbf0.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore(2,0,3)\\text{ lies on the line}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.56-q3","number":3,"question":"<p>Find a vector product equation of the line passing through:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-3,0,9)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(5,4,-2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-2,-1,-6)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-3,9,25)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}5\\\\4\\\\-2\\end{pmatrix}-\\begin{pmatrix}-3\\\\0\\\\9\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}8\\\\4\\\\-11\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\left(\\mathbf r-\\begin{pmatrix}-3\\\\0\\\\9\\end{pmatrix}\\right)\\times\\begin{pmatrix}8\\\\4\\\\-11\\end{pmatrix}=\\mathbf0.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}-3\\\\9\\\\25\\end{pmatrix}-\\begin{pmatrix}-2\\\\-1\\\\-6\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-1\\\\10\\\\31\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\left(\\mathbf r-\\begin{pmatrix}-2\\\\-1\\\\-6\\end{pmatrix}\\right)\\times\\begin{pmatrix}-1\\\\10\\\\31\\end{pmatrix}=\\mathbf0.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.56-q4","number":4,"question":"<p>Determine whether the following pair of lines are parallel or not:</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"l_1:\\left(\\mathbf r-\\begin{pmatrix}3\\\\9\\\\-12\\end{pmatrix}\\right)\\times\\begin{pmatrix}4\\\\2\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}=\\mathbf0,\\quad l_2:\\left(\\mathbf r-\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\3\\\\-4\\end{pmatrix}\\right)\\times\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}=\\mathbf0.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}4\\\\2\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}=k\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"4=k(2)\\Rightarrow k=2.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"2=k(1)\\Rightarrow k=2.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"1=k(0)\\Rightarrow k=0.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Inconsistent values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the lines are not parallel (or coincident).</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.56-q5","number":5,"question":"<p>Determine whether the following pair of lines are parallel, skew or if they intersect. If they intersect, find the point of intersection:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"l_1:\\left(\\mathbf r-\\begin{pmatrix}3\\\\-8\\\\4\\end{pmatrix}\\right)\\times\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\1\\\\4\\end{pmatrix}=\\mathbf0,\\quad l_2:\\left(\\mathbf r-\\begin{pmatrix}6\\\\5\\\\-3\\end{pmatrix}\\right)\\times\\begin{pmatrix}-4\\\\3\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}=\\mathbf0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"l_1:\\left(\\mathbf r-\\begin{pmatrix}5\\\\4\\\\2\\end{pmatrix}\\right)\\times\\begin{pmatrix}-1\\\\-5\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}=\\mathbf0,\\quad l_2:\\left(\\mathbf r-\\begin{pmatrix}3\\\\3\\\\4\\end{pmatrix}\\right)\\times\\begin{pmatrix}6\\\\5\\\\-6\\end{pmatrix}=\\mathbf0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"l_1:\\mathbf r=\\begin{pmatrix}3\\\\-8\\\\4\\end{pmatrix}+\\lambda\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\1\\\\4\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"l_2:\\mathbf r=\\begin{pmatrix}6\\\\5\\\\-3\\end{pmatrix}+\\mu\\begin{pmatrix}-4\\\\3\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"2=k(-4)\\Rightarrow k=-\\frac12.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"1=k(3)\\Rightarrow k=\\frac13.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"4=k(1)\\Rightarrow k=\\frac14.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Inconsistent values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the lines are not parallel (or coincident).</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"3+2\\lambda=6-4\\mu\\Rightarrow2\\lambda+4\\mu=3\\quad(1).\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"-8+\\lambda=5+3\\mu\\Rightarrow\\lambda-3\\mu=13\\quad(2).\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"4+4\\lambda=-3+\\mu\\Rightarrow4\\lambda-\\mu=-7\\quad(3).\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Solve (1) and (2): <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda=\\frac{61}{10}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mu=-\\frac{23}{10}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Check in (3):</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"4\\left(\\frac{61}{10}\\right)-\\left(-\\frac{23}{10}\\right)=\\frac{267}{10}\\ne-7.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So the lines do not intersect. <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"l_1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"l_2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are skew lines.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"l_1:\\mathbf r=\\begin{pmatrix}5\\\\4\\\\2\\end{pmatrix}+\\lambda\\begin{pmatrix}-1\\\\-5\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"l_2:\\mathbf r=\\begin{pmatrix}3\\\\3\\\\4\\end{pmatrix}+\\mu\\begin{pmatrix}6\\\\5\\\\-6\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"-1=k(6)\\Rightarrow k=-\\frac16.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"-5=k(5)\\Rightarrow k=-1.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"1=k(-6)\\Rightarrow k=-\\frac16.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Inconsistent values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the lines are not parallel (or coincident).</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"5-\\lambda=3+6\\mu\\Rightarrow-\\lambda-6\\mu=-2\\quad(1).\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"4-5\\lambda=3+5\\mu\\Rightarrow-5\\lambda-5\\mu=-1\\quad(2).\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"2+\\lambda=4-6\\mu\\Rightarrow\\lambda+6\\mu=2\\quad(3).\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Solve (1) and (2): <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda=-\\frac4{25}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mu=\\frac9{25}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Check in (3):</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"-\\frac4{25}+6\\left(\\frac9{25}\\right)=2\\quad\\text{as required}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So the lines intersect. Substitute <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda=-\\frac4{25}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> into <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"l_1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: The lines intersect at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\left(\\frac{129}{25},\\frac{24}{5},\\frac{46}{25}\\right)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.56-q6","number":6,"question":"<p>Find the acute angle between:</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"l_1:\\left(\\mathbf r-\\begin{pmatrix}3\\\\0\\\\-8\\end{pmatrix}\\right)\\times\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\-9\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}=\\mathbf0,\\quad l_2:\\left(\\mathbf r-\\begin{pmatrix}4\\\\-6\\\\-7\\end{pmatrix}\\right)\\times\\begin{pmatrix}7\\\\6\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}=\\mathbf0.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\cos\\theta=\\frac{\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\-9\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\\cdot\\begin{pmatrix}7\\\\6\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}}{\\left|\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\-9\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\\right|\\left|\\begin{pmatrix}7\\\\6\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\\right|}=\\frac{2\\times7+(-9)\\times6+0\\times1}{\\sqrt{2^2+(-9)^2+0^2}\\sqrt{7^2+6^2+1^2}}=\\frac{-40}{\\sqrt{85}\\sqrt{86}}=-\\frac{40}{\\sqrt{7310}}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\theta=\\arccos\\left(-\\frac{40}{\\sqrt{7310}}\\right)=117.894\\ldots^\\circ.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Acute angle is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"180^\\circ-117.894\\ldots^\\circ=62.1^\\circ\" data-display=\"false\"></span> (1 DP).</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.56-q7","number":7,"question":"<p>It is given that:</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"l_1:\\left(\\mathbf r-\\begin{pmatrix}5\\\\-8\\\\6\\end{pmatrix}\\right)\\times\\begin{pmatrix}3\\\\-7\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}=\\mathbf0,\\quad l_2:\\left(\\mathbf r-\\begin{pmatrix}-9\\\\10\\\\3\\end{pmatrix}\\right)\\times\\begin{pmatrix}-13\\\\1\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}=\\mathbf0.\" data-display=\"true\"></span><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Show that the lines <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"l_1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"l_2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> intersect. Hence find the coordinates of the point of intersection.</p></li><li><p>Find the acute angle between the lines <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"l_1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"l_2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>The point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> has position vector <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf i+15\\mathbf k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> lies on <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"l_1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> such that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"AB\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is perpendicular to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"l_1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Find the coordinates of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"l_1:\\mathbf r=\\begin{pmatrix}5\\\\-8\\\\6\\end{pmatrix}+\\lambda\\begin{pmatrix}3\\\\-7\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"l_2:\\mathbf r=\\begin{pmatrix}-9\\\\10\\\\3\\end{pmatrix}+\\mu\\begin{pmatrix}-13\\\\1\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"5+3\\lambda=-9-13\\mu\\Rightarrow3\\lambda+13\\mu=-14\\quad(1).\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"-8-7\\lambda=10+\\mu\\Rightarrow-7\\lambda-\\mu=18\\quad(2).\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"6+\\lambda=3-\\mu\\Rightarrow\\lambda+\\mu=-3\\quad(3).\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Solve (1) and (2): <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda=-\\frac52\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mu=-\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Check in (3):</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"-\\frac52-\\frac12=-3\\quad\\text{as required}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So the lines intersect. Substitute <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda=-\\frac52\" data-display=\"false\"></span> into <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"l_1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: The lines intersect at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\left(-\\frac52,\\frac{19}{2},\\frac72\\right)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\cos\\theta=\\frac{\\begin{pmatrix}3\\\\-7\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\\cdot\\begin{pmatrix}-13\\\\1\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}}{\\left|\\begin{pmatrix}3\\\\-7\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\\right|\\left|\\begin{pmatrix}-13\\\\1\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}\\right|}=\\frac{3\\times(-13)+(-7)\\times1+1\\times(-1)}{\\sqrt{3^2+(-7)^2+1^2}\\sqrt{(-13)^2+1^2+(-1)^2}}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{-47}{\\sqrt{59}\\sqrt{171}}=-\\frac{47}{\\sqrt{10089}}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\theta=\\arccos\\left(-\\frac{47}{\\sqrt{10089}}\\right)=117.899\\ldots^\\circ.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Acute angle is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"180^\\circ-117.899\\ldots^\\circ=62.1^\\circ\" data-display=\"false\"></span> (1 DP).</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\overrightarrow{OA}=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\15\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\overrightarrow{AB}=\\overrightarrow{OB}-\\overrightarrow{OA}=\\begin{pmatrix}5+3\\lambda\\\\-8-7\\lambda\\\\6+\\lambda\\end{pmatrix}-\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\15\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}4+3\\lambda\\\\-8-7\\lambda\\\\-9+\\lambda\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\overrightarrow{AB}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is perpendicular to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"l_1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}3\\\\-7\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\\cdot\\begin{pmatrix}4+3\\lambda\\\\-8-7\\lambda\\\\-9+\\lambda\\end{pmatrix}=0.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow3\\times(4+3\\lambda)-7\\times(-8-7\\lambda)+1\\times(-9+\\lambda)=0.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow12+9\\lambda+56+49\\lambda-9+\\lambda=0.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow59\\lambda+59=0.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\lambda=-1.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\overrightarrow{OB}=\\begin{pmatrix}5+3(-1)\\\\-8-7(-1)\\\\6+(-1)\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\-1\\\\5\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> has coordinates <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(2,-1,5)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.56-q8","number":8,"question":"<p>Write the following vector product equations of lines in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r=\\mathbf a+\\lambda\\mathbf b\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\left(\\mathbf r-\\begin{pmatrix}3\\\\-1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\\right)\\times\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\9\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}=\\mathbf0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\left(\\mathbf r-\\begin{pmatrix}4\\\\3\\\\-2\\end{pmatrix}\\right)\\times\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\2\\\\-3\\end{pmatrix}=\\mathbf0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r=\\begin{pmatrix}3\\\\-1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}+\\lambda\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\9\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r=\\begin{pmatrix}4\\\\3\\\\-2\\end{pmatrix}+\\lambda\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\2\\\\-3\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.56-q9","number":9,"question":"<p>Write the following vector product equations of lines in cartesian form:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\left(\\mathbf r-\\begin{pmatrix}3\\\\2\\\\-9\\end{pmatrix}\\right)\\times\\begin{pmatrix}4\\\\-2\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}=\\mathbf0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\left(\\mathbf r-\\begin{pmatrix}8\\\\-1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\\right)\\times\\begin{pmatrix}-2\\\\-3\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}=\\mathbf0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\left(\\mathbf r-\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\2\\\\9\\end{pmatrix}\\right)\\times\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\-2\\end{pmatrix}=\\mathbf0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{x-3}{4}=\\frac{y-2}{-2}=\\frac{z+9}{1}\\quad\\text{or}\\quad\\frac{x-3}{4}=\\frac{2-y}{2}=z+9.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{x-8}{-2}=\\frac{y+1}{-3}=\\frac{z-0}{1}\\quad\\text{or}\\quad\\frac{8-x}{2}=\\frac{y+1}{-3}=z.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{x-0}{1}=\\frac{z-9}{-2},\\quad y=2\\quad\\text{or}\\quad x=\\frac{9-z}{2},\\quad y=2.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.56-q10","number":10,"question":"<p>Write the following vector product equations in both vector form and cartesian form:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\left(\\mathbf r-\\begin{pmatrix}3\\\\-2\\\\4\\end{pmatrix}\\right)\\times\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\4\\\\2\\end{pmatrix}=\\mathbf0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\left(\\mathbf r-\\begin{pmatrix}3\\\\-7\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\\right)\\times\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\4\\\\-5\\end{pmatrix}=\\mathbf0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>Vector Form:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r=\\begin{pmatrix}3\\\\-2\\\\4\\end{pmatrix}+\\lambda\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\4\\\\2\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Cartesian Form:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x=3+\\lambda\\Rightarrow\\lambda=x-3.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=-2+4\\lambda\\Rightarrow\\lambda=\\frac{y+2}{4}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"z=4+2\\lambda\\Rightarrow\\lambda=\\frac{z-4}{2}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore x-3=\\frac{y+2}{4}=\\frac{z-4}{2}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>Vector Form:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r=\\begin{pmatrix}3\\\\-7\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}+\\lambda\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\4\\\\-5\\end{pmatrix}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Cartesian Form:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x=3.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=-7+4\\lambda\\Rightarrow\\lambda=\\frac{y+2}{4}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"z=0-5\\lambda\\Rightarrow\\lambda=\\frac{z}{-5}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore x=3,\\quad\\frac{y+2}{4}=\\frac{z}{-5}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]}]